WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:11.300
In a project, go down to its tasks

2
00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:14.800
Open the task

3
00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:18.500
Pull the sheet up to Attachments

4
00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:22.000
Tap Add Attachment

5
00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:25.900
A photo, a file, a scan — or From Library

6
00:00:25.900 --> 00:00:29.400
Find the file

7
00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:33.200
Tick the file

8
00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:36.700
Add

9
00:00:36.700 --> 00:00:40.900
It's on the task now

10
00:00:40.900 --> 00:00:50.400
Tap it to open it
